# Bench-only build arguments for Qualifire prompt-injection-sentinel (ModernBERT-large,
# English training data; not evaluated by its authors on other languages). Gated: the
# account must have accepted the conditions. Published under the Elastic License 2.0:
# commercial use is allowed, but not offering the model to third parties as a hosted or
# managed service (notices/qualifire-sentinel.txt). Not a supported sidecar profile:
# the unchanged sidecar image fails to load ModernBERT unless USER is set in the
# container (torch inductor calls getpass.getuser() for the non-root uid); the bench
# driver sets USER and TORCHINDUCTOR_CACHE_DIR for this model only (ADR 0023).
SIDECAR_MODEL_ID=qualifire/prompt-injection-sentinel
SIDECAR_MODEL_REVISION=e24131782819a4787c129ed2b9a4a67ae57a584e
SIDECAR_MODEL_SAFETENSORS_SHA256=fcba2fec67d9d2c5bd6e387f559255efd4f8b903ecaa2e97bdb9b46831f04239
SIDECAR_MALICIOUS_LABELS=jailbreak
SIDECAR_MODEL_NOTICE=notices/qualifire-sentinel.txt
SIDECAR_IMAGE_LICENSES=MIT AND Elastic-2.0
SIDECAR_MODEL_ATTRIBUTION=none
